# RSPICE-VERILOG-STIMULUS 1
#
# Eight selectors chosen so that each of the three case statements takes a
# different arm from the other two at least once, and so that every arm of
# every one of them -- including all three defaults -- is taken.
#
# The operands change halfway through, which is what makes the implicit
# sensitivity list load-bearing: a process that woke only on `sel` would keep
# the first pair's answers.

module case_forms

input sel 4
input a 8
input b 8

output exact 8
output wildz 8
output wildx 8
output hit 1

step 10
settle 5

vector 0000 10101010 11001100
vector 0001 10101010 11001100
vector 0010 10101010 11001100
vector 0011 10101010 11001100
vector 0101 11110000 00001111
vector 1010 11110000 00001111
vector 1111 00000000 11111111
vector 0110 00000000 11111111
